# {{ORG}} fleet roster: TEMPLATE rendered by `fleet launch` into .fleet/roster.
# Format: the engsys agent-sessions roster (<engsys>/core/skills/agent-sessions/roster.example).
# Double-underscore tokens are filled from fleet/fleet.conf at launch time; a token that names an
# unset key fails the launch rather than starting a session half-configured.
NAMESPACE={{NAMESPACE}}
ENV_FILE=__ENV_DIR__/session.env
{{#if github_app}}
PREFLIGHT=bash __ENGSYS_DIR__/core/fleet/identity/gh-app-login.sh __GH_APP_ENV__
{{/if}}
{{#if azure}}
PREFLIGHT=bash __ENGSYS_DIR__/stacks/cloud/azure/fleet/az-sp-login.sh __AZURE_SP_ENV__
{{/if}}
#
# <name>|<workdir>|<initial prompt>|<extra flags>[|<env file>]
# Names start with the namespace (the messaging trust fence). Models and effort come from fleet/fleet.conf.
{{#if marketplace}}
# The monsters find their per-repo config through the "fleet config dir:" line that the instance
# plugin's SessionStart hook injects (plugin/repos/<owner>/<repo>/).
{{/if}}
{{#unless marketplace}}
# The monsters read their per-repo config from the fleet config dir passed in the prompt.
{{/unless}}
#
# Monsters: unattended, each owns one ledger issue (register them in fleet/supervisor.conf.tmpl).
{{NAMESPACE}}-mm|__PIN_DIR__|/engsys:merge-monster{{CONFIG_DIR_ARG}}|--model __MM_MODEL__ --effort __MM_EFFORT__ --remote-control --dangerously-skip-permissions
# The maintenance lane runs in its own env (the 5th field): alias pins for the security model.
{{NAMESPACE}}-maintain|__PIN_DIR__|/engsys:maintenance-monster{{CONFIG_DIR_ARG}}|--model __MAINTAIN_MODEL__ --effort __MAINTAIN_EFFORT__ --remote-control --dangerously-skip-permissions|__ENV_DIR__/security.env
{{#if resource_broker}}
# The resource broker (optional third monster) arbitrates the host's scarce shared resources, a pool of
# slots such as test ports and databases, among the sessions: it reaps grants whose holder died and relays
# grant nudges. It actuates access; the environment-health decisions stay with the maintenance lane.
{{NAMESPACE}}-broker|__PIN_DIR__|/engsys:resource-broker{{CONFIG_DIR_ARG}}|--model __BROKER_MODEL__ --effort __BROKER_EFFORT__ --remote-control --dangerously-skip-permissions
{{/if}}
#
# Interactive roles: attended, never auto-relaunched. Worktrees live outside the session's working
# directory, so --add-dir is what stops every edit there from prompting.
{{NAMESPACE}}-build|__PIN_DIR__||--add-dir __WORKTREES_DIR__ --model __BUILD_MODEL__ --effort __BUILD_EFFORT__ --remote-control --permission-mode __INTERACTIVE_PERMISSION_MODE__
{{NAMESPACE}}-investigate|__PIN_DIR__||--add-dir __WORKTREES_DIR__ --model __INVESTIGATE_MODEL__ --effort __INVESTIGATE_EFFORT__ --remote-control --permission-mode __INTERACTIVE_PERMISSION_MODE__
{{NAMESPACE}}-design|__PIN_DIR__||--add-dir __WORKTREES_DIR__ --model __DESIGN_MODEL__ --effort __DESIGN_EFFORT__ --remote-control --permission-mode __INTERACTIVE_PERMISSION_MODE__
